{"turn_id": "d11-t1", "session_id": "d11", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "models_used", "text": "该论文使用两个已发表的、采用编码器-解码器架构的图像描述模型来训练和评估数据集：Neural Image Captioning (NIC) 模型和 Yunjey 的 Pytorch-tutorial 图像描述模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}]}, {"key": "encoder_decoder_structure", "text": "模型中，CNN 先用于编码器部分提取图像特征，图像特征以向量形式作为解码层的输入；解码器部分使用 RNN-LSTM 将向量嵌入为目标句子。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-6a524ef8fe27746863a8c5f0"}]}, {"key": "model_names_in_results", "text": "实验结果表中总结了 Pytorch-tutorial 和 NIC - Show and Tell 两个模型的实验结果，两个模型分别在 English-sportball、GT-sportball、UIT-ViIC 三个数据集上训练。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-721ac9d3e099bacb12ac84aa"}]}, {"key": "experiments_count", "text": "论文在结论中表述为在两个流行的现有图像描述模型上进行了若干实验，以评估它们学习两个越南语数据集的效率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-df82acb31723d02ba4213f1a"}]}, {"key": "evaluation_datasets", "text": "评估时，每个数据集使用验证子集中的 924 张图像来验证模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.00175", "chunk_id": "c-721ac9d3e099bacb12ac84aa"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d11-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
